---
title: Syniti Migrate → SAP LTMC — Fluxo de carga de Purchase Orders
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuário (TB)
    participant UI as Syniti Migrate UI
    participant SKP as SKP ETL (DEV/LOAD DB)
    participant GW as SAP Gateway<br/>MIG_MC_ODATA_SRV
    participant DPC as /LTB/CL_MIG_MC_ODATA_DPC_EXT
    participant LTMC as LTMC Framework<br/>(mc_proxy_factory)
    participant STG as Staging Tables<br/>/1LT/DSSxxxxxxx
    participant PO as SAP MM (EKKO/EKPO)

    Note over User,UI: Etapa 1 — Load Program Setup

    User->>UI: Abre LTMC Load Program
    UI->>GW: GET /MigrationProjectSet
    GW->>DPC: MIGRATIONPROJECT_GET_ENTITYSET
    DPC->>LTMC: get_projects(cntxt)
    LTMC-->>DPC: Lista de projetos
    DPC-->>GW: Feed OData
    GW-->>UI: Projetos (ZTEST_PO_SKP, ZSKP_WORK_ORDERS…)
    UI-->>User: Exibe tabela "Existing LTMC Projects"

    User->>UI: Preenche formulário<br/>(SKP System, Env, Nome, MO, Approach)
    UI->>GW: POST /MigrationProjectSet<br/>(changeset CREPROJ)
    GW->>DPC: changeset_begin → CREATE_ENTITY
    DPC->>DPC: check_execute_auth_for_request()
    DPC->>DPC: check_system_upgrade()
    DPC->>LTMC: maintain_project(CREATE)
    LTMC-->>DPC: MigrationProjectUUID
    DPC-->>GW: 201 Created + UUID
    GW-->>UI: MigrationProjectUUID

    UI->>GW: GET /MigrationProjectSet('…')/to_MigrationObjects
    GW-->>UI: MigrationObjectUUID (MM PO)
    UI->>GW: GET /MigrationObjectSet(…)/to_TableStructure
    GW-->>UI: 9 tabelas (S_EKKO…S_COMP) com /1LT/DSSxxxxxxx

    Note over User,SKP: Etapa 2 — ETL Export Task

    User->>UI: Mapeia origem→destino,<br/>seleciona "Map By Name"
    User->>UI: Clica "Run Export"
    UI->>SKP: Executa job ETL<br/>(PO_EKKO_T, PO_EKPO_T…)
    SKP->>STG: INSERT INTO /1LT/DSS41002602 (S_EKKO)
    SKP->>STG: INSERT INTO /1LT/DSS41002605 (S_EKPO)
    SKP->>STG: INSERT INTO /1LT/DSS41002607 (S_EKKN)
    SKP-->>UI: Records Exported, Last Run

    Note over User,PO: Etapa 3 — Run & Monitor

    User->>UI: Define paralelismo (4)
    UI->>GW: POST /SetParallelJobs?<br/>MigrationProjectUUID=…&<br/>MigrationObjectUUID=…&NumBackgroundJob=4
    GW->>DPC: EXECUTE_ACTION SetParallelJobs
    DPC->>LTMC: SET_PARALLEL_JOBS
    LTMC-->>DPC: OK
    DPC-->>UI: 200 OK

    User->>UI: Escolhe Simulation ou Production
    UI->>GW: POST /StartMigration?<br/>ProjectUUID=…&ObjectUUID=…&AllRecords=true
    GW->>DPC: EXECUTE_ACTION StartMigration
    DPC->>LTMC: MO_MIGRATION_TRANSACTION
    LTMC->>STG: Lê registros do staging
    LTMC->>PO: BAPI_PO_CREATE1 (via ME21N)
    PO-->>LTMC: EBELN novo ou erro
    LTMC-->>DPC: Status por instância
    DPC-->>UI: 202 Accepted (job em background)

    loop Polling do progresso
        UI->>GW: GET /MigrationProjectSet('…')/to_TaskProcessing
        UI->>GW: GET /ActivityMonitorSet?$filter=…
        UI->>GW: GET /ApplicationLogSet?$filter=…
        GW-->>UI: Progresso + eventos
        UI-->>User: Atualiza barras + Activity Log
    end

    UI->>GW: GET /MigrationInstanceSet?$filter=…
    GW-->>UI: Legacy PO# → New SAP PO#
    UI-->>User: Tabela "Load Results — PO Readback"
